text Once lunch break ends, it's back to hours of languid boredom.
text Next to me, Sunohara is asleep on his desk, after having shown up late and everything.
text Bored, I look out the window.
text The cherry blossoms have scattered, and the school's front lawn has now become a sea of green.
text It's empty and quiet now, but I'm sure it will be bustling during Founder's Festival.
text And once Founder's Festival is finally over...
text I'll be able to go places and have fun with Nagisa.
text I pass the time by imagining what we'll do and how it'll go.
